[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955122201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107309#issuecomment-2955122201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107309","id":2955122201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wI5YZ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T08:52:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T08:57:49Z","body":"I wonder if we can auto validate it without making the key even less secure, maybe generate some extra metadata file with key hash and check it during export.\r\n\r\nThe same can also be used to validate if correct template version is used.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955122201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957199691","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107309#issuecomment-2957199691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107309","id":2957199691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wQ0lL","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-09T22:40:30Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T22:40:30Z","body":"> I also considered whether to print the value of the key so they can confirm it matches their expectations, but chose not to as it might be considered a security issue to print it in clear (e.g. it may be used on CI with a secret).\r\n\r\nCI services generally perform a string match on logs to redact secrets, but it's not 100% reliable and most CI services recommend not relying on this mechanism.\r\n\r\nThat said, we could choose to display the first 4 characters so you know you're not using the wrong key (it's 64 characters long, so this only reveals minimal information).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957199691/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]